      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:36:19 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.1.3</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed the toolbar flickering when switching between buckets</li>
          <li>Switching buckets is faster: each bucket remembers its folder and listing</li>
          <li>Toolbar and file list header now look more like Finder</li>
          <li>Added View &gt; Show/Hide Sidebar (Control-Command-S)</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
