    <item>
      <title>Version 0.1.0</title>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:42:21 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.1.0</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>First release of Bucket List, a native Mac app for Cloudflare R2</li>
          <li>Sign in with Cloudflare: no access keys to copy</li>
          <li>Browse buckets in list or icon view with image thumbnails, like Finder</li>
          <li>Press Space to Quick Look images, video, PDFs and documents</li>
          <li>Upload by dragging files or folders in, and download to your Downloads folder</li>
          <li>Copy public links (custom domain or r2.dev) or private links that expire</li>
          <li>Upload from Finder: right-click files, choose Services, Upload with Bucket List</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
